One-Sentence Summary

This entire document is proposing a centralized Volvo Network Automation platform where ServiceNow approvals trigger Ansible automation, GitHub governs code, NSoT becomes the single source of network truth, and network controllers/devices are automatically managed to enable NetDevOps and NRE practices with self-healing and closed-loop automation.

As a Network Automation Engineer working with AAP, GitHub, ServiceNow and SD-WAN, you should primarily focus on understanding NSoT → GitHub → AAP → ServiceNow integration and the closed-loop automation flow, because that is the core of the entire solution.
